		(property "Description" "22uF 16V 0805 X5R, AEM CSRC buffer at BUFSRC (aem10300 Table 6: min 13uF EFFECTIVE - footnote 1 names DC-bias derating). Re-picked 2026-07-30 (audit #2) from 0603/10V GRT188R61A226ME13D, which held only ~9-12uF at the 3.1-4.15V MPP bias. 16V 0805 holds ~15-17uF. 1.25mm max. Fits in place (gaps SC3 0.529/L2 0.575/SB2 0.776mm); 1206 does NOT fit."
